// Angle (UnifiedPipes; README "Unified pipes"): a copper or lead plate bent once at a right angle,
// two legs 8 voxels wide and 1 thick, 8 long (shapes/item/angle.json), so two make the game's chute
// section's 8 x 8 box. Forged on the anvil from one ingot (recipes/smithing/angle.json) or folded on
// the press brake from one plate. Two angles, two tin or silver solder bars and a soldering iron make
// one chute section, the hollow section (recipes/grid/chutesection.json). Marked disabled with the
// switch off.
{
	code: "angle",
	variantgroups: [
		{ code: "metal", states: ["copper", "lead"] }
	],
	behaviors: [
		{ name: "GroundStorable", properties: { layout: "SingleCenter", collisionBox: { x1: 0.25, y1: 0, z1: 0.25, x2: 0.75, y2: 0.5, z2: 0.75 } } }
